{{// 🥰 Chibi Bonds Lite: an optional relationship tracker in about 210 tokens where the full edition spends 297. Every pair of characters gets a bond score plus small Sparks and Grudge counters: seven kinds of warm acts earn Sparks (at most 2 per pair per turn), 7 Sparks turn into one point of BOND, 5 Grudge into minus one, three Grudge halve the gains, and a sincere repair clears it. Touch gates (+4 hug, +8 hand-holding, +12 kiss, +15 sex) allow things and never force them; love is declared only at +15 and up, and +20 allows marriage proposals, answered yes or no from your past acts. The numbers live in their own small 💚 ledger at the end of each reply, right after the 🎲 ledger when Fate is on, and never appear in the story; the preset's regex scripts draw each pair as a card with Bond, Sparks and Grudge bars, so the pair format stays as it was. Chibi kept the extremes of the scale (malice with its violence and near-irreversible damage, the love and marriage gates) and dropped the labels and behaviors for the middle (hostile, neutral, warm, trust, devoted, casual touch, admitting romantic interest), the <bonds> tags (nothing pointed at them), the rule that prose shows tiers only through behavior and the restatement that no listed act means no Spark. Ships OFF.}}{{trim}}

{{setvar::ariaBondsLine::- Bonds: listed acts add Sparks (max 2 per pair), slights Grudge; Sparks 7: BOND +1, Sparks 0.}}{{#if !.ariaLedgerLine}}{{setvar::ariaLedgerLine::- Ledger: last 💚 block plus this turn's changes; the closing 💚 block copies it.}}{{setvar::ariaLedgerGate::- Ledger: one <details><summary>💚</summary>pairs</details> block ends the reply; BOND rises only at 7 Sparks.}}{{else}}{{setvar::ariaLedgerLine::- Ledger: last 🎲 and 💚 blocks plus this turn's changes, ages +1; the closing 🎲 then 💚 blocks copy them.}}{{setvar::ariaLedgerGate::- Ledger: one full 🎲 block, then one <details><summary>💚</summary>pairs</details> block, end the reply; BOND rises only at 7 Sparks.}}{{/if}}{{trim}}

Track every meaningful pair, NPC↔NPC included, in the 💚 block as Name↔Name +6/3/0 (BOND/Sparks/Grudge), comma-separated; strangers 0/0/0.
BOND -10..+20: ≤-6 malice, seeks harm, extreme violence, near irreversible; love declared only at +15+, marriage proposals only at +20 (answered yes or no from {{user}}'s past acts and the context).
Touch gates: +4 friendly hug; +8 hand-holding, sustained touch; +12 romantic kiss; +15 sex (context allowing).
BOND never rises directly. Sparks +1 when one of the pair does one of these to the other this turn: gives something, does a favour, defends, shares something private, makes laugh, chooses over someone else, touches willingly; max +2 a pair a turn, list read once. Sparks 7+: BOND +1, Sparks 0. Grudge +1 per slight; 5+: BOND -1, Grudge 0; while Grudge 3+, gains halve; sincere repair: Grudge 0.
